<span>2026年03月08日</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>第二轮</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2026年03月09日</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2026年04月06日</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>第三轮</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2026年04月07日</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>2026年04月30日</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营（Mini营）设有三个申请轮次，项目将采用滚动审核方式，建议有意向的同学尽早提交申请材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>*注意事项：</span><span><span>夏令营申请无需本科院校推免资格。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/rVN4PBK7WGTc3B7JEXicDkrcRuvYfIeQqHicOfxMLxdbpRUR3t2TpL2ow0DJwhouB5LGXa9oQnwauqvY4FeD52rg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>特别提示</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>Important Notice</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/tYBGQJ9TRKmFIILGaibFDkS34XqEkpLjjUvicZber5q0tZxVz1213Zwe96fRW3dkuCaaD6vDY5GwhGPgcsjKqUQw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>  新增理工科背景学生专场考核！</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/tYBGQJ9TRKmFIILGaibFDkS34XqEkpLjjicYGCvibf4RG1GcaibrC1awT89JS5KgiaVLrSA4tLHs2X0N5slAm8MFviag/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>经济学硕士项目不限制申请人本科专业</span></span></strong><span>，除经济学相关专业外，我们也热忱欢迎具备良好数理与技术基础、且对经济学感兴趣的同学跨专业申请，尤其是以下本科专业的申请者：</span><span><span>数学、统计学、物理学、计算机、数据科学、大数据技术、人工智能、电子工程、软件工程、机械工程</span></span><span>等；或经管类专业，同时辅修上述理工类专业的申请者。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>今年经济学硕士夏令营（Mini营）将特别增设</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>理工科背景学生专场考核</span></span></strong><span>，旨在为理工科背景申请者提供</span><span><span>更具针对性的考核</span></span><span>机会。我们鼓励具备理工科背景的同学积极申请，欢迎加入我们，一起探索 “</span><span><strong><span>AI + 经济学</span></strong></span><span>” 的复合型人才培养之路！</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/rVN4PBK7WGTc3B7JEXicDkrcRuvYfIeQqHicOfxMLxdbpRUR3t2TpL2ow0DJwhouB5LGXa9oQnwauqvY4FeD52rg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2027 Intake</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>/ 考核与活动安排 /</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>01 考核形式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>考核形式为</span><span><span>个人面试</span></span><span>（面试时长约15分钟，英文），将分“</span><span><span>线上</span></span><span>”和“</span><span><span>线下</span></span><span>”两种模式进行，入营同学可自行选择参与线上或线下考核场次。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>02 考核活动安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>线上模式</span></span></strong><span>：仅设置线上考核环节</span></p><p><strong><span><span>线下模式</span></span></strong><span>：除考核外，同学们将有机会来到校园，参加</span><span><span>项目介绍会</span></span><span><span>、学长学姐交流分享会、深高金职业发展中心介绍会、校园参观</span></span><span>等活动。活动时长：1天</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>03 报名须知</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>① 具体考核时间、活动安排请以项目组后续入营通知邮件为准。</span></p><p><span>② 入营同学可根据后续邮件指引填写自己希望参加的考核场次（线上、线下考核标准一致）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/w37MZHRhp09gVic8GibIQM0fia4ibt25Tiabg6XTMJn3KSvniboANYwMpKoIcxHt3xbytfXzT3F8VQrF2gLea9iapVAdQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/6WChWUP5tJWqlAot8L8dHlIzJgibyic2v6wzbbPDVn1ztjLcO9oACGksic73xIibr0UcMHWnsaEA2WrWIVFZ1hlDoA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/6WChWUP5tJWqlAot8L8dHlIzJgibyic2v6PXHqXwSIruNvqicm912tdJAVxVsZP9Fl1KU1angHib55zMwgVcBHEibSA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/6WChWUP5tJWqlAot8L8dHlIzJgibyic2v6TBaNE0MTQTDdMNXIj8KOickrCe80elReLyWOPMSWynouKGEbdB0xCwQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/w37MZHRhp09gVic8GibIQM0fia4ibt25Tiabg6XTMJn3KSvniboANYwMpKoIcxHt3xbytfXzT3F8VQrF2gLea9iapVAdQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z8CicUUibpPl0pnxJ6L4PrluRPepbrtIn5STzVKSia867mibxypwCtDd3HvbE6pXvG8ttu3bQICjdwJsqGdx2PqJCw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>经济学硕士项目</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span>夏令营-Mini营</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>申请要求及材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>MSc in Economics Programme </span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/6WChWUP5tJWqlAot8L8dHlIzJgibyic2v6kDhcla2CeibH1BicoFRK8K2YTtzqJ0VcpZBLHe5HHlkzZM6LreauyWNQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z8CicUUibpPl0pnxJ6L4PrluRPepbrtIn5STzVKSia867mibxypwCtDd3HvbE6pXvG8ttu3bQICjdwJsqGdx2PqJCw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 申请要求</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/X5LvkEQF1ZEQezO5NETWI4TPbUttJBppYX5MCoJWe9ZUBMgRYvU4NO2umictgxhqZqbc4Lf81d5RhCZRrk6XTGA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>申请者需同时符合以下三个条件：</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>大学本科三年级学生（2027年应届毕业生）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>本科成绩在本校同年级本专业中排名优异，或在其他方面有突出表现，不限制申请人本科专业</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>英语水平要求：英语四级不低于550分；或英语六级不低于520分；或雅思（学术类）不低于6.5（考试中心/Online）；或托福不低于550（笔试）或不低于79分（机考/在家考）；或GMAT（Verbal）不低于21分；或GMAT Focus Edition（Verbal）不低于78分；或其它可证明英文水平的考试</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2. 申请材料</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/X5LvkEQF1ZEQezO5NETWI4TPbUttJBppYX5MCoJWe9ZUBMgRYvU4NO2umictgxhqZqbc4Lf81d5RhCZRrk6XTGA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本科前5学期（或前2年）在校成绩单（校级公章）</span></p></section><section><p><span>* 申请者需上传官方开具的完整成绩单及绩点计算说明扫描件，若成绩单上未体现加权平均分或平均绩点，则请同时上传一份官方开具的加权平均分/平均绩点证明（校级公章）。多份文件建议合成一份PDF上传。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本科前5学期（或前2年）在校成绩专业排名（由院系/教务部门盖章），请与成绩单合并为一份文件提交</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>相关英语能力资格证书，如英语四级、英语六级、托福、雅思、GMAT等</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>个人陈述（英文）：600字左右</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>个人简历（英文）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>两封推荐信，填写两位推荐人的信息</span></p></section><section><p><span>* 系统会自动发送含上传链接的邮件至推荐人邮箱，推荐信需有推荐人签名。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>身份证正反面扫描件</span></p></section><section><p><span>* 须将身份证正反面扫描至文件同一页面。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>其他证明材料，如已发表的论文、奖状、各类证书扫描件等</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>除上述文件要求外，建议但不强制要求提交个人介绍视频：</span></p></section><section><p><span>1分钟时长（个人全英语录制）；</span></p><p><span>需上传个人介绍视频的申请人，请上传视频至第三方平台（小红书或抖音），并将视频链接粘贴至PDF文件内，提交至申请系统中的“其他文件”提交项内。项目组将通过点击链接的方式查看申请人的个人介绍视频。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>3. 申系统填写注意事项</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/X5LvkEQF1ZEQezO5NETWI4TPbUttJBppYX5MCoJWe9ZUBMgRYvU4NO2umictgxhqZqbc4Lf81d5RhCZRrk6XTGA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>个人基本信息部分</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>姓名：需填写中文全名。</span></p></li><li><p><span>证件类型/证件号：中国国籍学生请填写身份证信息，切勿填写护照信息。</span></p></li><li><p><span>身份证复印件正反面：上传身份证（正反面）扫描件，并请注意身份证有效期。</span></p></li></ul></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学历部分</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>大学名称：本科学历为中国境内高校，请用中文填写学校、专业名称及相关信息。</span></p></li><li><p><span>GPA/GPA总分：请填写与官方成绩单或均分证明完全一致的加权平均分成绩，输入格式为所获成绩/总分（如：87/100，3.7/4.0）。</span></p></li><li><p><span>成绩单原件扫描件：请上传完整成绩单，需包括绩点计算说明，并与在校成绩排名证明文件扫描成同一个PDF格式文件上传。</span></p></li></ul></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推荐人部分</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>推荐人邮箱：请正确填写推荐人邮箱，申请人提交申请后系统将自动发送邮件至推荐人邮箱，推荐人可通过点击邮件中的链接填写并上传推荐信。</span></p></li><li><p><span>推荐信：两封推荐信中至少一封为学术导师推荐。推荐信没有固定格式要求，中英文皆可。推荐信需要老师签名，手签或电子签，请勿直接粘贴截图。</span></p></li></ul></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>补充信息/材料部分</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>身份证复印件正反面：请以pdf格式上传身份证（正反面）彩色扫描件（边缘完整，信息清晰，尺寸与实体一致），并请注意身份证有效期需在6个月以上。</span></p></li></ul></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z8CicUUibpPl0pnxJ6L4PrluRPepbrtIn5STzVKSia867mibxypwCtDd3HvbE6pXvG8ttu3bQICjdwJsqGdx2PqJCw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>MSc in Economics Programme </span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/6WChWUP5tJWqlAot8L8dHlIzJgibyic2v6pkFbmoEy7iaDrQcXBUKsricMfYfLykAwsrbWxwrCosm8jEj8967Liatzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z8CicUUibpPl0pnxJ6L4PrluRPepbrtIn5STzVKSia867mibxypwCtDd3HvbE6pXvG8ttu3bQICjdwJsqGdx2PqJCw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人须登录申请系统在线提交申请材料。请选择：</span><strong><span><span>经济学(AY2027-28</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>夏令</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>营)</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请网址：</span></p><p><strong><span><span>https://pgapply.cuhk.edu.cn </span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请费用：100元，不设退款。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z8CicUUibpPl0pnxJ6L4PrluRPepbrtIn5STzVKSia867mibxypwCtDd3HvbE6pXvG8ttu3bQICjdwJsqGdx2PqJCw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>了解更多</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>MSc in Economics Programme </span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><sp